{"id":50780,"date":"2026-04-23T22:35:31","date_gmt":"2026-04-23T21:35:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50780"},"modified":"2026-09-03T18:51:52","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T17:51:52","slug":"ultra-caminho-do-peregrino","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ultra-caminho-do-peregrino\/","title":{"rendered":"Ultra Caminho do Peregrino 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ultra Caminho do Peregrino 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ultra Caminho do Peregrino 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um dos mais extraordin\u00e1rios desafios de ultra-endurance pedestre na Pen\u00ednsula Ib\u00e9rica, realizando-se de <strong>4 a 6 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> ao longo do m\u00edtico <strong>Caminho Portugu\u00eas Central de Santiago<\/strong>. Com uma dist\u00e2ncia aproximada de <strong>188 km<\/strong> em regime de semi-autonomia non-stop e um tempo limite estrito de <strong>48 horas<\/strong>, a prova une a cidade hist\u00f3rica de <strong>Barcelos<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>) \u00e0 emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Catedral de Santiago de Compostela<\/strong> na Galiza.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida na sexta-feira \u00e0s 10h00 na <strong>Avenida da Liberdade em Barcelos<\/strong>, enfrentar\u00e1s uma travessia cont\u00ednua de m\u00e1xima supera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica e mental por Balug\u00e3es, Ponte de Lima, Valen\u00e7a (km 67), Pontevedra (km 123), Caldas de Reis e Padr\u00f3n, orientando-te pelas setas amarelas jacobeias e navega\u00e7\u00e3o por GPS. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo<\/strong> limita o evento a apenas 30 participantes, garantindo <strong>dois sacos de apoio pessoal (drop bags at\u00e9 3 kg)<\/strong> em Valen\u00e7a e Pontevedra, postos de abastecimento, geolocalizador GPS em tempo real e transporte de regresso garantido de Santiago para Barcelos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida da Liberdade, Barcelos, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">188 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Ultra Caminho do Peregrino (188 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 150.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/05)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 175.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/06)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 200.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/07)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 225.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a partida do Ultra Caminho do Peregrino 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida tem lugar na sexta-feira, 4 de setembro de 2026, \u00e0s 10h00 na Avenida da Liberdade, em Barcelos (com secretariado \u00e0s 08h00 e briefing \u00e0s 09h45), terminando na Catedral de Santiago de Compostela at\u00e9 \u00e0s 10h00 de domingo, 6 de setembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a extens\u00e3o total do percurso e o tempo limite da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem uma dist\u00e2ncia de aproximadamente 188 km ao longo do Caminho Portugu\u00eas Central, com um tempo limite total de 48 horas em regime non-stop de semi-autonomia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as barreiras hor\u00e1rias e os pontos de apoio interm\u00e9dios com sacos pessoais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Existem duas barreiras hor\u00e1rias com assist\u00eancia de sacos pessoais (drop bags at\u00e9 3 kg): em Valen\u00e7a (km 67) \u00e0s 02h00 de s\u00e1bado (16h de prova) e em Pontevedra (km 123) \u00e0s 17h00 de s\u00e1bado (31h de prova).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que material obrigat\u00f3rio \u00e9 exigido aos participantes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio inclui sistema de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o com capacidade m\u00ednima de 1500 ml, aparelho ou rel\u00f3gio GPS com autonomia para toda a prova, geolocalizador fornecido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o, manta t\u00e9rmica, dois sistemas de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o com pilhas de reserva, imperme\u00e1vel, telem\u00f3vel operacional com som, reserva m\u00ednima de 1000 calorias, apito e dorsal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte de regresso a Barcelos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura de forma faseada o transfer de regresso em carrinhas de apoio de Santiago de Compostela para Barcelos consoante a chegada dos atletas \u00e0 meta, estando o transporte inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Caminho do Peregrino 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida da Liberdade, Barcelos\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Barcelos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a partida do Ultra Caminho do Peregrino 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida tem lugar na sexta-feira, 4 de setembro de 2026, \u00e0s 10h00 na Avenida da Liberdade, em Barcelos (com secretariado \u00e0s 08h00 e briefing \u00e0s 09h45), terminando na Catedral de Santiago de Compostela at\u00e9 \u00e0s 10h00 de domingo, 6 de setembro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a extens\u00e3o total do percurso e o tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova tem uma dist\u00e2ncia de aproximadamente 188 km ao longo do Caminho Portugu\u00eas Central, com um tempo limite total de 48 horas em regime non-stop de semi-autonomia.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as barreiras hor\u00e1rias e os pontos de apoio interm\u00e9dios com sacos pessoais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Existem duas barreiras hor\u00e1rias com assist\u00eancia de sacos pessoais (drop bags at\u00e9 3 kg): em Valen\u00e7a (km 67) \u00e0s 02h00 de s\u00e1bado (16h de prova) e em Pontevedra (km 123) \u00e0s 17h00 de s\u00e1bado (31h de prova).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que material obrigat\u00f3rio \u00e9 exigido aos participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio inclui sistema de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o com capacidade m\u00ednima de 1500 ml, aparelho ou rel\u00f3gio GPS com autonomia para toda a prova, geolocalizador fornecido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o, manta t\u00e9rmica, dois sistemas de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o com pilhas de reserva, imperme\u00e1vel, telem\u00f3vel operacional com som, reserva m\u00ednima de 1000 calorias, apito e dorsal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o transporte de regresso a Barcelos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura de forma faseada o transfer de regresso em carrinhas de apoio de Santiago de Compostela para Barcelos consoante a chegada dos atletas \u00e0 meta, estando o transporte inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66762,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":